{"id":"8fdba87feab50061","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf.md","title":"第三版 CNF 的无用符号附加条件","display":"df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf — 第三版 CNF 的无用符号附加条件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf","aliases":["73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf"],"display":"df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf — 第三版 CNF 的无用符号附加条件","depends_on":["[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]","[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1.1 and §7.1.5, print pp. 262–264, 272; PDF pp. 284–286, 294; complete third-edition CNF condition","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf — 第三版 CNF 的无用符号附加条件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd76b0e857c90848\" href=\"?note=cd76b0e857c90848\" title=\"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf\">73-df-epsilon-free-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1.1 and §7.1.5, print pp. 262–264, 272; PDF pp. 284–286, 294; complete third-edition CNF condition"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\">\\(G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma\">\\(X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma\\)</span>；一般推导关系采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76137a7886cfb97a\" href=\"?note=76137a7886cfb97a\" title=\"73-df-cfg-derivation\">73-df-cfg-derivation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Useful}_G(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n[\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*uXv\\land uXv\\Rightarrow_G^*w].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Useful}_G(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n[\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*uXv\\land uXv\\Rightarrow_G^*w].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BookCNF}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\land\\forall X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma\\;\\operatorname{Useful}_G(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BookCNF}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\land\\forall X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma\\;\\operatorname{Useful}_G(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第三版 p.272 在 A→BC/A→a 之后还要求没有无用符号。原有 CNF₀ 只表示规则形状，适合作为 CYK 等算法的局部接口，但不把它伪称为教材全部条件。终结字母表里没有出现在任何生成词中的字符，也属于此处应删除的无用符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-epsilon-free-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-epsilon-free-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma$，$X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma$；一般推导关系采用 [[73-df-cfg-derivation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Useful}_G(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists u,v\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*\\;\\exists w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n[\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*uXv\\land uXv\\Rightarrow_G^*w].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BookCNF}(G)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{CNF}_0(G)\\land\\forall X\\in V\\cup\\Sigma\\;\\operatorname{Useful}_G(X).","display":true}],"bytes":1589,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd76b0e857c90848","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第三版正文还要求无用符号已经删除；完整条件见 [[73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf]]。CNF₀ 本身不包含这个附加条件，允许作为空语言文法及算法的形状接口。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf|第三版 CNF 的无用符号附加条件]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"0b91495e20376554","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"非空性保证 S 留在第一步。任一成功推导只使用可生成变量；第二步只保留可达产生式，且从可达的可生成变量导出终结词的推导不会经过不可达变量，所以两种性质同时成立。顺序颠倒可能重新产生不可达变量；第三版 §7.1.1, pp.262–264 讨论了该顺序问题。固定 Σ 中未出现的终结字符允许保留，这是固定字母表的本地版本；第三版完整 CNF 还会删除无用终结符，见 [[73-df-useful-symbol-and-book-cnf]]。"},{"id":"6c59b8611811cc62","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["cd76b0e857c90848","76137a7886cfb97a"]}